{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝要保護耶路撒冷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"禍哉！那些下埃及求幫助的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是因仗賴馬匹，倚靠甚多的車輛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並倚靠強壯的馬兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻不仰望以色列的聖者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不求問耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實，耶和華有智慧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必降災禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並不反悔自己的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻要興起攻擊那作惡之家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又攻擊那作孽幫助人的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人不過是人，並不是上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的馬不過是血肉，並不是靈。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華一伸手，那幫助人的必絆跌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那受幫助的也必跌倒，都一同滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對我如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子和少壯獅子護食咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是喊許多牧人來攻擊牠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠總不因他們的聲音驚惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不因他們的喧嘩縮伏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如此，萬軍之耶和華","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必降臨在錫安山岡上爭戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雀鳥怎樣搧翅覆雛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華也要照樣保護耶路撒冷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必保護拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要越門保守。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["以色列人哪，你們深深地悖逆耶和華，現今要歸向他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，各人必將他金偶像銀偶像，就是親手所造、陷自己在罪中的，都拋棄了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"亞述人必倒在刀下，並非人的刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有刀要將他吞滅，並非人的刀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必逃避這刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的少年人必成為服苦的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的磐石必因驚嚇挪去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的首領必因大旗驚惶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是那有火在錫安、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有爐在耶路撒冷的耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}